# CVE/misconfig exceptions for Trivy gates in .github/workflows/trivy.yml.
# Format: <CVE-ID or AVD-ID> exp:YYYY-MM-DD  # reason + review date (YYYY-MM-DD); exp: is optional
# Do not silence findings without a documented reason — this file is reviewed in PRs.

