KSV-0014  # charts/web-dashboard readOnlyRootFilesystem needs emptyDir mounts for nginx cache/pid, tracked as follow-up, review 2026-12-17
AWS-0132 exp:2027-01-11  # legacy deploy/aws/raw buckets (sa-east-1, SSE-S3, raw IAM scope of #294) until the raw migration (EPIC #365 gap 4); an ID entry is not path-scoped, so the SSE-S3 production buckets keep their own inline ignores, review 2027-01-11
